# A smaller stand-in for the shared model, for computers that cannot run qwen3:8b (DECISIONS.md 20).
# Create it under the same name, so nothing else changes:
#   ollama pull qwen3:1.7b
#   ollama create qwen3-agents -f contracts/ollama/Modelfile.1.7b
# This replaces the 8B qwen3-agents if you had it; run the main Modelfile again to switch back.
# Download 1.4 GB; needs about 3.5 GB of memory with the 16K context. For older computers. Expect
# many more mistakes, especially with tools.
# Same Qwen3 release and chat template as qwen3:8b. The settings below must match the main Modelfile.
FROM qwen3:1.7b
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER temperature 0
PARAMETER seed 42
